  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab>Perform'd but Once.<lb/>
               Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, <date when="1811-06-11">Tuesday June 11, 1811</date>.<lb/>
               Will be presented, an Historical Play, in Three Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Royal Oak.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With entire New Scenery, Dresses and Decorations.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">New Musick</hi> Composed by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hodson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hemings</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Stokes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hillington</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Houghton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>Messrs. <actor>Brown,</actor> <actor>Caulfield,</actor> <actor>Diether,</actor> <actor>Eames,</actor> <actor>Field,</actor> <actor>Gray,</actor> <actor>Griffith,</actor> <actor>Hall,</actor> <actor>Harrison,</actor> <actor>Lawson,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor>Oddwell,</actor> <actor>Robert,</actor> <actor>Sherriff,</actor> <actor>Thomson,</actor> <actor>Terry,</actor> <actor>Willoughby,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Linton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem>Mr. <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Miller</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Silver</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Salker</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Taylor</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Thomas</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wilson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Wheatley</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss Watson,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Miss De Camp,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. Stokes,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. Haughton,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. Kendall,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Miss Danton.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Glover</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="italic">The Dresses by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Tobin</hi> and Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Scenery designed, and executed by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Maria</hi>, and Assistants.</hi><lb/>
               After which, the Musical Entertainment of The<lb/>
               <bibl><title>Agreeable Surprise.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Felix Friendly,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Compton,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Eugene,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Chicane,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>John,</role> <actor>Mr. Finn.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Thomas,</role> <actor>Mr. Minton.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Cudden,</role> <actor>Mr. Widdicombe.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Stump,</role> <actor>Mr. Lewes.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lingo,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Laura,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mrs. Cheshire,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Leserve</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Fringe,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Cowslip,</role> <actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Historical Play of <quote>"The <hi rend="allcaps">Royal Oak,</hi>"</quote> perform'd last night, for the first<lb/>
               time, was honour'd with strong and general marks of interest and applause, excited by the<lb/>
               incidents, and the conduct of them.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd that, in consequence of the satisfaction express'd<lb/>
               by a numerous and brilliant Audience, <hi rend="italic">this Play</hi> will be repeated every Evening, till fur-<lb/>
               ther notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
